<title>SPAIN: Telefonica approves board changes.</title>
<headline>Telefonica approves board changes.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's telecommunications group Telefonica de Espana said on Wednesday its board unanimously approved changes in its composition, in an expected move.</p>
<p>Telefonica, whose remaining 20.9 percent state stake is currently being sold, said in a statement it reduced the number of board members to 18 from 24 and reshuffled those on the board.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
